<h2>Intermediate — 11 Ways to Turn Sessions into a System</h2>

<p>The <a href="#!tip-beginner">beginner part</a> was about keeping one session clean; the intermediate part is about <strong>moving whatever repeats into the system</strong>. Run research in parallel, freeze a good prompt into a skill, use CLAUDE.md as a router — tips 10 through 20 of the public tutorial, checked against the official docs.</p>

